<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Oct-Dec unemployment 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Oct-Dec unemployment 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Thursday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Oct-Dec*  Sep-Nov   Jun-Aug   Sep-Nov</p>
<p>			 1996	1996	1996	1995</p>
<p> Unemployment	 2.7	 2.7	 2.8	 3.6</p>
<p> Underemployment    1.6	 1.5	 1.4	 2.2</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
